# === Duffel (flights + hotels) ===
# Sign up free (self-serve, no sales call) at https://duffel.com
# Dashboard -> Developers -> Access tokens. Start with a test-mode key
# (starts with "duffel_test_") to try real search results risk-free, then
# switch to a live key ("duffel_live_") once you're ready to accept bookings.
# NOTE: Amadeus for Developers' self-service portal was decommissioned on
# July 17, 2026 (now enterprise/sales-only), which is why this project uses
# Duffel instead. Searches are free; small fees only apply to confirmed
# bookings. Without this key, the site automatically falls back to
# realistic demo data.
DUFFEL_API_KEY=

# === AI itinerary generation (Claude / Anthropic API) ===
# Get a key at https://platform.claude.com/ (Settings -> API Keys).
# Without this, the site falls back to a template-based sample itinerary.
# With it, itineraries are also grounded in live web search (see below).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5

# === Affiliate IDs (optional, for revenue once approved) ===
# Booking.com Affiliate Partner Program: https://www.booking.com/affiliate-program/v2/index.html
BOOKING_AFFILIATE_ID=
# Almosafer partner program (contact Almosafer/Seera Group business development)
ALMOSAFER_AFFILIATE_ID=
